WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.701 --> 00:00:04.100
♪♪

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.734
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:07.901
According to a new report,
top Democrats

00:00:07.901 --> 00:00:09.934
are starting to worry
that President Biden

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:12.367
will run for re-election
in 2024,

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:14.834
specifically this top Democrat.

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:17.634
[ As Biden ] "Oh, do I have to?"

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:20.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:22.067
After the House committee
investigating

00:00:22.067 --> 00:00:24.701
the Capitol attack
showed video testimony last week

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:27.334
of Ivanka Trump saying
that she did not believe

00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:29.501
her father's claims
of election fraud,

00:00:29.501 --> 00:00:31.334
former President Trump
said that she,

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:33.601
"Checked out of
election results."

00:00:33.601 --> 00:00:37.000
Though to be fair, that's just
what people used to do

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.834
after an election was over.

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:40.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:42.434
The House committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:00:42.434 --> 00:00:44.200
today held
its second public hearing.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.634
They weren't going to,
but then Rudy Giuliani said,

00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:49.167
"Make it a double."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:52.167
Fox News today also aired
coverage

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:54.801
of the House January 6th
committee's second hearing.

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:57.601
Said Fox News viewers,
"Bam, I'm on TV!"

00:00:57.601 --> 00:00:59.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:01.868
"Remember that thing?"

00:01:01.868 --> 00:01:06.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:09.767
Police in Idaho on Saturday
arrested 31 members

00:01:09.767 --> 00:01:12.234
of the white supremacist group
Patriot Front

00:01:12.234 --> 00:01:15.167
after they were discovered
inside of a U-Haul truck

00:01:15.167 --> 00:01:17.067
near an LGBTQ Pride event.

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:19.067
And based on the photo,
I assume

00:01:19.067 --> 00:01:21.868
Patriot Front is
a style of khakis?

00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:23.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.634 --> 00:01:25.367
You got flat front,
pleated front,

00:01:25.367 --> 00:01:26.534
and Patriot Front.

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:29.901
And, uh, those
only come in extra small.

00:01:29.901 --> 00:01:31.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:33.667
Oh, you thought they were
packed into that U-Haul.

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:37.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.033 --> 00:01:39.868
The Labor Department
announced on Friday

00:01:39.868 --> 00:01:42.567
that inflation has hit
a new 40-year high.

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:44.801
You will now pay the same amount

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:46.567
for a banana
at the grocery store

00:01:46.567 --> 00:01:49.834
as you used to pay for a banana
at an airport Starbucks.

00:01:49.834 --> 00:01:51.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.601 --> 00:01:53.701
"Forbes" magazine
announced last week

00:01:53.701 --> 00:01:56.167
that golfer Tiger Woods is
officially a billionaire,

00:01:56.167 --> 00:01:58.667
leaving him no choice
but to start a company

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:00.400
to launch him into space.

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.567 --> 00:02:04.567
The Tony awards
were held last night,

00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:07.501
and "A Strange Loop"
won Best Musical.

00:02:07.501 --> 00:02:11.067
It's the musical adaptation
of my penis.

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:13.667
No!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.667 --> 00:02:16.701
I'm not doing that joke.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:23.234 --> 00:02:25.667
And finally, Ikea in Norway
has launched

00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:28.868
an online baby-name generator
based on its product line.

00:02:28.868 --> 00:02:31.167
They just figured you should
have something from Ikea

00:02:31.167 --> 00:02:33.133
that lasts more than a year.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:36.701
In an interview
with CNN last night,

00:02:36.701 --> 00:02:40.367
White House Press Secretary
Karine Jean-Pierre was asked

00:02:40.367 --> 00:02:42.901
if President Biden's age
or stamina

00:02:42.901 --> 00:02:45.601
will be a challenge
in his reelection bid.

00:02:45.601 --> 00:02:47.133
Said Jean-Pierre, "No,

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:48.367
everything else will."

00:02:48.367 --> 00:02:50.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.567
President Biden criticized
large corporations

00:02:52.567 --> 00:02:54.901
for keeping prices high
to boost profits,

00:02:54.901 --> 00:02:56.467
in a speech last week, and said,

00:02:56.467 --> 00:02:59.701
"Exxon made more money than God
last year."

00:02:59.701 --> 00:03:02.367
Worse, they made it by selling
a natural resource,

00:03:02.367 --> 00:03:04.934
so that's technically
God's money.

00:03:04.934 --> 00:03:06.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.701 --> 00:03:08.200
During her opening statement

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.100
at yesterday's hearing
on the Capitol attack,

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:12.901
Republican Representative
Liz Cheney said that

00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:16.167
an "apparently inebriated
Rudy Giuliani

00:03:16.167 --> 00:03:17.367
told former President Trump

00:03:17.367 --> 00:03:20.100
to falsely claim he won
on election night."

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.901
To be fair, his legal advice

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:23.701
doesn't get any better
when he's sober.

00:03:23.701 --> 00:03:25.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:25.534 --> 00:03:26.734
"Are you drunk again?"

00:03:26.734 --> 00:03:28.300
[ As Giuliani ]
Trust me, it's just as bad.

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.234 --> 00:03:32.968
During yesterday's congressional
hearing, it was revealed

00:03:32.968 --> 00:03:35.534
that Donald Trump Jr.'s fiancée,
Kimberly Guilfoyle,

00:03:35.534 --> 00:03:39.667
was paid $60,000 to speak at the
rally before the Capitol attack.

00:03:39.667 --> 00:03:41.934
Well, technically,
$20,000 to speak

00:03:41.934 --> 00:03:44.901
and then $40,000 to please stop.

00:03:44.901 --> 00:03:46.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.367 --> 00:03:47.701
When asked if he will support

00:03:47.701 --> 00:03:50.100
the bipartisan
gun legislation framework,

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:53.367
Republican Senator Mike Braun
said he was open to it,

00:03:53.367 --> 00:03:56.133
but added he was,
"interested to see

00:03:56.133 --> 00:03:57.567
where the NRA is on it,"

00:03:57.567 --> 00:04:00.868
which is a little like saying
you're open to eating healthier,

00:04:00.868 --> 00:04:04.701
but are interested to see
how Oreos feel about it, first.

00:04:04.701 --> 00:04:06.133
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.133 --> 00:04:08.667
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
over the weekend appeared

00:04:08.667 --> 00:04:11.434
on an episode of
"RuPaul's Drag Race All Stars."

00:04:11.434 --> 00:04:15.000
Either that, or she didn't,
and that person should win.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:20.133 --> 00:04:21.267
I mean --

00:04:21.267 --> 00:04:24.000
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:04:25.634 --> 00:04:27.501
Mick Jagger announced yesterday

00:04:27.501 --> 00:04:29.567
he tested positive
for the coronavirus

00:04:29.567 --> 00:04:31.834
and Keith Richards announced
that's the only thing

00:04:31.834 --> 00:04:33.534
he's tested negative for.

00:04:33.534 --> 00:04:36.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:37.801 --> 00:04:40.434
Beyoncé recently deleted
her profile pictures

00:04:40.434 --> 00:04:41.934
on all social media platforms.

00:04:41.934 --> 00:04:45.434
I just hope I can remember
what Beyoncé looks like.

00:04:45.434 --> 00:04:46.968
[ Subdued laughter ]

00:04:46.968 --> 00:04:49.300
Former President Trump
turned 76 today,

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.634
so now, he's really asking
everyone to stop the count.

00:04:52.634 --> 00:04:55.634
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:04:55.634 --> 00:04:57.968
That's right, today was
former President Donald Trump's

00:04:57.968 --> 00:04:59.834
76th birthday.
Pretty impressive --

00:04:59.834 --> 00:05:03.000
76, and he can still get
an insurrection.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.934
[ Laughter ]

00:05:05.934 --> 00:05:08.901
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:05:11.467 --> 00:05:13.000
That man was our president!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.667
[ Laughter ]

00:05:17.868 --> 00:05:20.334
And, finally, rapper Snoop Dogg
recently tweeted

00:05:20.334 --> 00:05:22.868
that the full-time blunt roller
he hired

00:05:22.868 --> 00:05:26.367
now makes up to $50,000 a year,

00:05:26.367 --> 00:05:29.467
which has to be the smallest
salary she's ever made.

00:05:29.467 --> 00:05:31.834
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:05:31.834 --> 00:05:33.434
I bet they're
beautifully rolled.

00:05:33.434 --> 00:05:36.834
[ Laughter ]
I bet they're beautifully,
artisanally rolled.

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:40.267
President Biden
sent a letter today

00:05:40.267 --> 00:05:42.634
to oil companies
and called on them

00:05:42.634 --> 00:05:45.701
to produce more in order
to alleviate high prices.

00:05:45.701 --> 00:05:48.667
So if you needed more proof
that he's an old man,

00:05:48.667 --> 00:05:51.434
he still thinks you can get
things done with a letter.

00:05:51.434 --> 00:05:53.834
[ Laughter ]

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:58.400
[ Applause ]

00:05:58.400 --> 00:05:59.534
According to a new poll,

00:05:59.534 --> 00:06:02.200
President Biden's
approval rating is at 40%,

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:03.601
meaning that his approval rating

00:06:03.601 --> 00:06:06.400
is the only thing
inflation hasn't touched.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:08.000
[ Laughter ]

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.834
Republicans Senator Tom Cotton
reportedly met yesterday

00:06:10.834 --> 00:06:12.734
with two dozen of his top donors

00:06:12.734 --> 00:06:15.701
to discuss a potential
2024 presidential campaign

00:06:15.701 --> 00:06:18.467
and said that former
President Trump's candidacy

00:06:18.467 --> 00:06:19.834
wouldn't prevent him
from running,

00:06:19.834 --> 00:06:21.234
only from winning.

00:06:21.234 --> 00:06:22.834
[ Laughter ]

00:06:22.834 --> 00:06:25.200
After recent
congressional testimony

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:27.934
claimed that he was drunk on
the night of the 2020 election,

00:06:27.934 --> 00:06:29.767
Rudy Giuliani tweeted yesterday

00:06:29.767 --> 00:06:32.567
that he had refused all alcohol
that evening

00:06:32.567 --> 00:06:34.267
and only drank Diet Pepsi,

00:06:34.267 --> 00:06:37.934
although being drunk sounds like
the reason you give

00:06:37.934 --> 00:06:40.200
for drinking Diet Pepsi.

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:43.100
"Dude, I was so
messed up last night,

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:44.801
I drank a Diet Pepsi."

00:06:44.801 --> 00:06:47.267
[ Laughter ]

00:06:47.267 --> 00:06:49.868
The K-pop group BTS
announced yesterday

00:06:49.868 --> 00:06:52.033
that they're going on
an indefinite hiatus.

00:06:52.033 --> 00:06:54.067
Said President Biden,
"Aw, man!

00:06:54.067 --> 00:06:56.167
They're gonna blame me
for this, too."

00:06:56.167 --> 00:06:58.868
[ Laughter ]

00:06:58.868 --> 00:07:00.601
Elon Musk tweeted today

00:07:00.601 --> 00:07:02.868
that he just voted Republican
for the first time,

00:07:02.868 --> 00:07:05.968
but only because there were
no candidates running as Sith.

00:07:05.968 --> 00:07:08.868
[ Laughter ]

00:07:12.434 --> 00:07:15.834
Microsoft today formally
shut down Internet Explorer.

00:07:15.834 --> 00:07:18.567
Well, technically,
it just shut down itself

00:07:18.567 --> 00:07:20.100
and then they couldn't
restart it.

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:22.767
[ Laughter ]

00:07:22.767 --> 00:07:25.701
A man in the UK recently
got a tattoo on his feet

00:07:25.701 --> 00:07:28.167
that looks like a pair of shoes.

00:07:28.167 --> 00:07:31.868
Said the man, "It hurt, but not
as much as the underwear."

00:07:31.868 --> 00:07:35.100
[ Gasps, laughter ]

00:07:37.601 --> 00:07:40.834
"There's just so much white."

00:07:43.634 --> 00:07:46.167
Authorities in Michigan
recently discovered

00:07:46.167 --> 00:07:48.601
an alligator
in the front seat of a car

00:07:48.601 --> 00:07:49.734
during a traffic stop.

00:07:49.734 --> 00:07:51.701
Even crazier, driver's side.

00:07:51.701 --> 00:07:55.067
[ Laughter ]

00:07:56.367 --> 00:07:59.634
And finally,
a cooking duo on TikTok

00:07:59.634 --> 00:08:00.968
set a Guinness World Record

00:08:00.968 --> 00:08:03.334
by creating the world's largest
chicken nugget.

00:08:03.334 --> 00:08:05.534
Now, for the bad news.

00:08:05.534 --> 00:08:07.601
[ Crowd groans ]

00:08:15.434 --> 00:08:17.567
Scollins!

00:08:18.767 --> 00:08:22.701
The White House today announced
plans to form a task force

00:08:22.701 --> 00:08:24.334
to combat online harassment.

00:08:24.334 --> 00:08:26.567
Go to their website to check out
the announcement,

00:08:26.567 --> 00:08:32.033
but head's up --
do not read the comments.

00:08:32.033 --> 00:08:34.634
Dr. Anthony Fauci
tested positive yesterday

00:08:34.634 --> 00:08:36.567
for a breakthrough case
of the coronavirus.

00:08:36.567 --> 00:08:39.400
Wow. Fauci is like
COVID's final boss.

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:42.067
This is like hearing

00:08:42.067 --> 00:08:45.801
that the Coyote caught
the Roadrunner.

00:08:45.801 --> 00:08:47.367
Also, you caught it now?

00:08:47.367 --> 00:08:49.734
You made it through
all that time

00:08:49.734 --> 00:08:52.767
in the maskless Trump
White House

00:08:52.767 --> 00:08:54.234
and you caught it now?

00:08:54.234 --> 00:08:56.701
That's like running
a triathlon with no problems

00:08:56.701 --> 00:09:00.100
and then throwing your back out
petting a dog.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.400
[ Laughter ]

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.400
Florida yesterday
became the only state

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:06.200
to skip pre-ordering doses
of the coronavirus vaccine

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.367
for young children.

00:09:07.367 --> 00:09:10.167
To be fair, Florida
doesn't have children.

00:09:10.167 --> 00:09:12.300
[ Laughter ]

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:13.701
Authorities in New York
this week

00:09:13.701 --> 00:09:17.033
seized more than a dozen
Weed World Candies trucks

00:09:17.033 --> 00:09:19.934
because some owed
more than half a million dollars

00:09:19.934 --> 00:09:21.033
in parking tickets.

00:09:21.033 --> 00:09:23.801
Said the drivers, "Parking?

00:09:24.834 --> 00:09:28.067
[ Laughter ]

00:09:29.033 --> 00:09:31.400
We thought we were speeding."

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.501
[ Laughter ]

00:09:33.501 --> 00:09:35.434
Organizers of
a British music festival

00:09:35.434 --> 00:09:38.601
announced that rapper Lil Wayne
will no longer perform

00:09:38.601 --> 00:09:40.834
after he was denied
entry into the UK

00:09:40.834 --> 00:09:42.467
because on his health form
screening,

00:09:42.467 --> 00:09:45.534
he put down that he was Weezy.

00:09:45.534 --> 00:09:47.567
[ Laughter ]

00:09:50.868 --> 00:09:54.467
I mean, it's not great,
but it tracks.

00:09:54.467 --> 00:09:56.901
And finally, producers
of the upcoming "Barbie" movie

00:09:56.901 --> 00:09:59.834
released a picture yesterday
of actor Ryan Gosling as Ken

00:09:59.834 --> 00:10:02.334
with bleached blond hair
and a six pack abs,

00:10:02.334 --> 00:10:04.367
and in homage
to the original toy,

00:10:04.367 --> 00:10:06.767
his head was
facing the wrong way.

00:10:06.767 --> 00:10:07.834
[ Laughter ]

00:10:07.834 --> 00:10:09.801
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

